/* Raider Immersions: one set per immersion. Barriers follow Jason Beyer's "Eight Areas" model from A Theology of Encounter (Peru 2026):
   each area has In plain terms, Find this one, If you get further, Where to look, Nature / Luck / Built, Who gains, and a question to carry.
   Students find the numbers; this site points to where. Sources are starting points: check the latest table yourself. */
